WEBVTT

00:15:59.951 --> 00:16:05.118
and that's as large numbers
of black people begin to become free,

00:16:05.142 --> 00:16:07.801
starting in the North in the 1820s.

00:16:08.246 --> 00:16:09.982
In other words,

00:16:10.006 --> 00:16:15.037
this word is fundamentally
an assault on black freedom,

00:16:15.061 --> 00:16:16.553
black mobility,

00:16:16.577 --> 00:16:18.674
and black aspiration.

00:16:19.691 --> 00:16:20.842
Even now,

00:16:20.866 --> 00:16:25.143
nothing so swiftly unleashes
an N-word tirade

00:16:25.167 --> 00:16:27.857
as a black person asserting their rights

00:16:27.881 --> 00:16:31.275
or going where they please or prospering.